The key element of radio was first an understanding that there were radio waves.

299
00:24:42,301 --> 00:24:45,160
This is James Clark Maxwell in the 1860s,

300
00:24:45,220 --> 00:24:51,440
and he describes the elements of non-optical radiation and that this should be available.

301
00:24:51,441 --> 00:24:56,440
Heinrich Hertz in the 1880s produces radio waves.

302
00:24:56,441 --> 00:25:02,440
And then it's a bunch of people in the 1890s, Marconi of course, Nicola Tesla and others,

303
00:25:02,441 --> 00:25:07,440
who were experimenting in various ways to make this a practical device

304
00:25:07,441 --> 00:25:12,440
where you can send a radio wave from here and receive it over here efficiently.

