00:25:12,441 --> 00:25:20,440
Guglielmo Marconi did exhaustive tests to demonstrate that radio waves would in fact travel through the air,

306
00:25:20,441 --> 00:25:25,420
the air. Once a signal such as Morse code or voice transmissions were added, it was

