00:25:41,801 --> 00:25:46,640
telegraph were enormous. Ships in the middle of the ocean could now send

311
00:25:46,641 --> 00:25:52,780
distress signals at the first sign of trouble, a feat previously impossible with the wired telegraph.

312
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:58,680
By the 1920s, the signal sent had progressed from a series of clicks to voice transmissions,

